        "text": "**Defining the Approach**\n\nI'm starting to formalize the plan. The objective is clear: generate a `select_platform_resource.py` file with code tailored for Google Cloud Vertex. This code will act as a resolver, ensuring the correct resource is chosen prior to execution. I am now working on making the external provider (Vertex) explicitly identifiable.\n\n\n**Constructing the Resolver**\n\nMy focus is now on the script's content. I'm formulating the `select_platform_resource.py` file, aiming for a resolver function. I've chosen Vertex AI as the specific provider. I'm structuring a Python function that takes a project ID, location, and model ID, using the Vertex AI SDK to identify and return the model resource. I'll include the necessary imports for the `google.cloud.aiplatform` library.\n\n\n",
