      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud's Vertex AI as the concrete external provider for this project. Now, the next stage involves making this choice explicitly identifiable within the Python script, `invoke_platform_model.py`.\n\n\n**Pinpointing the Implementation**\n\nI'm now fully committed to integrating Vertex AI. My focus is now on the Python script. I have decided to name this script `invoke_platform_model.py`. I'll start by importing the `google.cloud.aiplatform` library. I'll define a function to receive project ID, location, and model name. I'll initialize the Vertex AI client within this function and then invoke a text model with sample input, before returning the result.\n\n\n",
